    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chuma chanmwekesheleliyi Mwanta Yehova. Kutala, muloŋa wanyikabu yahankanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Eyi Amosa, wunamoni chumanyi? Nami, Muloŋa wanyikabu yahankanza. Yehova hakuŋila nindi, Antu ami aIsarela kunayikumi dehi, hinakahitilaku nawa cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu tumina twamutembeli twakabalumuka kukaloka nyiteti. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. Afu akavula; akayinatolaŋa hanzi kwejima kwejima chawumweneni hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwakeŋa a kuminya abula yuma, mukaŋeshi atuzweŋi amwituŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwelaŋa nenu, Kakweji kakafwa ifukwinyi, kulonda twakalandishaŋa kudya kwansaachi? Sabata yikuhita mwakanyi kulonda twakalandishi tidiku, twakakeheshi chimpaya, twakatoheshi lushekeli, twakabalumuni pezu yiikali yakudimbana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda twakalandi kazweŋi nasiliva, twakalandi wabula yuma namasapatu ayedi, twakalandishi tidiku jankuuku jashalashalaŋa? Tiyenu munukuyileja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nasanyiki dehi kulema kwaYakoba, nindi, Chalala yuma yaneluwu yejima hinamba kayivulamenaku haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa dibuli kuzaala nachumichi, niantu ejima ashakamamu abuli kudishonashona? Mwalala, dakababa dejima neyi Kaloŋa, dakabwankaŋila, dakanyikumuka cheŋi neyi Kaloŋa kaEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Hefuku odu nakahumisha itaŋwa iku dichidi mukachi kewulu, nakeyilisha hanu hamaseki iku kuchidi mwaana to-o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawija yenu nakayibalumuna kudishonashona, tumina twenu twejima nakatubalumuna nyikeŋa yakudila; nakavwikisha antu ejima yikeleyi mumbunda, nakatewisha antu ejima tuwewa; nakayidilisha kudila kudi neyi kwakudila mwana wasemuka wunka, kukuma kwayumoyu kwakekala neyi ifuku dalula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, kwakenza mafuku inakaleta nzala mwituŋa, hinzala yayakudyaku, hela mpwila yamejuku, yakela nzala vakutiya mazu aYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akata mbatamba, afuma kaluŋalwiji aka, aya kaluŋalwiji kakwawu, afuma kukabeta kakuchimunswa, aya kumusela; akaya niniku niniku lufuchi nakukeŋakeŋa izu daYehova, hiyakadimonaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku odu ayaloŋadima amawahi nianyikwenzi akaheŋela nampwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa asanyikaŋa muloŋa waSamariya, nawu, Eyi Dani, chahandayi Nzambi yeyi kwaamu; nawu, Chahanda njila yaBerisheba kwaamu; wenawa diwu akadimbuka, hiyamba kanyamuka nawa cheŋuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
